### 4. Create RBSE board

POST {{baseUrl}}/boards
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "RBSE",
  "name": "Board of Secondary Education Rajasthan",
  "description": "State education board of Rajasthan.",
