### 5. Get all boards

GET {{baseUrl}}/boards
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 6. Get active boards

GET {{baseUrl}}/boards/active
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 7. Find board by code

GET {{baseUrl}}/boards/code/{{boardCode}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 8. Get board by database ID

GET {{baseUrl}}/boards/{{boardId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 9. Update board

PATCH {{baseUrl}}/boards/{{boardId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Updated description for the education board."
}


### 10. Deactivate board

PATCH {{baseUrl}}/boards/{{boardId}}/deactivate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 11. Activate board

PATCH {{baseUrl}}/boards/{{boardId}}/activate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 12. Duplicate-code test

POST {{baseUrl}}/boards
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
